    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4160" root="تهم" body-key="t">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَهِيمٌ</span></b>  <i>Suspected; thought evil of;</i> (JK in this
art., and Msb in this and in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وهم</span>;) [as also
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُتَّهَمٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُتْهَمٌ</span></b> :] or <i>being an object of suspicion;</i>
as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُتْهِمٌ</span></b> . (K in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وهم</span>. [In the CK, the
latter is erroneously written <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُتَّهِمٌ</span>.])

